DESCRIPTION >
    - Cumulative (running-total) star count time series for a project or curated collection,
    replacing `activities_cumulative_count.pipe` for stars only.
    - GitHub repos: no per-user star events exist any more - the cumulative
    total comes from star snapshots through `stars_github_as_of.pipe`, which returns the total
    as of each bucket's end (or `endDate` without granularity).
    - Non-GitHub (GitLab) repos: unaffected by that change, still counted from per-event `star`
    activities the normal way - read directly off `activityRelations_bucket_routing` /
    `activityRelations_collection_bucket_routing` (the same tables `activities_filtered.pipe`
    itself routes to), filtered `platform != 'github'`, since `activities_filtered.pipe` has no
    platform-exclusion parameter to reuse as-is. Only segments in `stars_gitlab_segments.pipe`
    are read, so GitHub-only projects and collections skip that scan.
    - Exactly one of `project` / `collectionSlug` must be given, same contract as
    `activities_filtered.pipe`. `bucketId` is required alongside `collectionSlug` (resolved via
    `collection_buckets.pipe`) for the same reason `activities_filtered.pipe` needs it - Tinybird
    renders Jinja before any SQL runs, so it can't branch on a bucket id only ClickHouse can
    compute. The insights backend's Tinybird client already resolves and injects `bucketId`
    transparently for both `project` and `collectionSlug` on every pipe call, same as it does
    for every other pipe today.
    - Parameters:
    - `project`: Project slug (e.g. 'k8s'). Inherited from `segments_filtered`.
    - `collectionSlug`: Collection slug (e.g. 'cncf'). Inherited from `segments_filtered_by_collection`.
    - `repos`: Optional array of repository URLs to restrict to.
    - `startDate`: Optional DateTime, only affects which buckets `generate_timeseries` produces.
    - `endDate`: Optional DateTime, snapshot/summary cutoff and bucket upper bound.
    - `granularity`: Optional string ('daily', 'weekly', 'monthly', 'quarterly', 'yearly').
    - Response:
    - Without granularity: `cumulativeActivityCount` (single row)
    - With granularity: `startDate`, `endDate`, `cumulativeActivityCount` per bucket
    - Response field names deliberately match `activities_cumulative_count.pipe` so `stars.ts`
    can swap the pipe name with no other code changes.
    - **Known limitation**: a bucket earlier than a repo's first backfilled snapshot has no
    snapshot to `argMax` over and reads as 0 stars for that repo, not "unknown" - undercounts
    early buckets until the star-snapshot backfill fully lands, never overcounts.

TOKEN "insights-app-token" READ

NODE stars_github_summary
DESCRIPTION >
    No-granularity mode: GitHub total as of `endDate`, or the latest snapshots without it.

SQL >
    %
    {% if not defined(granularity) %}
        SELECT githubStars AS githubCumulativeStars FROM stars_github_as_of WHERE kind = 'end'
    {% else %} SELECT 0 AS githubCumulativeStars
    {% end %}

NODE stars_github_bucketed
DESCRIPTION >
    Granularity mode: per-bucket GitHub cumulative total, as of the bucket's end capped at
    `endDate`. `stars_github_as_of.pipe` returns every bucket, with 0 when the scope has no
    GitHub repos.

SQL >
    %
    {% if defined(granularity) %}
        SELECT startDate, endDate, githubStars AS githubCumulativeStars
        FROM stars_github_as_of
        WHERE kind = 'bucket'
    {% else %} SELECT toDate(now()) AS startDate, toDate(now()) AS endDate, 0 AS githubCumulativeStars
    {% end %}

NODE stars_gitlab_summary
DESCRIPTION >
    No-granularity mode: total non-GitHub star events up to `endDate` (or all-time).

SQL >
    %
    {% if not defined(granularity) %}
        SELECT count() AS gitlabCumulativeStars
        FROM
            {% if defined(collectionSlug) %} activityRelations_collection_bucket_routing
            {% else %} activityRelations_bucket_routing
            {% end %} as a
        WHERE
            {% if defined(collectionSlug) %}
                {% if defined(bucketId) %}
                    segmentId IN (SELECT segmentId FROM segments_filtered_by_collection)
                    AND a.collectionSlug = {{ String(collectionSlug) }}
                {% else %} 1 = 0
                {% end %}
            {% else %} segmentId = (SELECT segmentId FROM segments_filtered)
            {% end %}
            AND type = 'star'
            AND platform != 'github'
            AND segmentId IN (SELECT segmentId FROM stars_gitlab_segments)
            AND channel NOT IN (SELECT channel FROM repos_to_channels_excluded)
            {% if defined(repos) %} AND channel IN (SELECT channel FROM repos_to_channels) {% end %}
            {% if defined(endDate) %}
                AND timestamp
                <= {{ DateTime(endDate, description="Cumulative as of date", required=False) }}
            {% end %}
    {% else %} SELECT 0 AS gitlabCumulativeStars
    {% end %}

NODE stars_gitlab_cumulative
DESCRIPTION >
    Granularity mode: non-GitHub star events, cumulative (historical baseline + rolling sum),
    same rolling-sum pattern as `activities_cumulative_count.pipe` but restricted to
    `platform != 'github'`, read directly off the bucket-routing tables.

SQL >
    %
    {% if defined(granularity) %}
        WITH
            gitlab_historical AS (
                SELECT count() AS c
                FROM
                    {% if defined(collectionSlug) %} activityRelations_collection_bucket_routing
                    {% else %} activityRelations_bucket_routing
                    {% end %} as a
                WHERE
                    {% if defined(collectionSlug) %}
                        {% if defined(bucketId) %}
                            segmentId IN (SELECT segmentId FROM segments_filtered_by_collection)
                            AND a.collectionSlug = {{ String(collectionSlug) }}
                        {% else %} 1 = 0
                        {% end %}
                    {% else %} segmentId = (SELECT segmentId FROM segments_filtered)
                    {% end %}
                    AND type = 'star'
                    AND platform != 'github'
                    AND segmentId IN (SELECT segmentId FROM stars_gitlab_segments)
                    AND channel NOT IN (SELECT channel FROM repos_to_channels_excluded)
                    {% if defined(repos) %}
                        AND channel IN (SELECT channel FROM repos_to_channels)
                    {% end %}
                    {% if defined(startDate) %}
                        AND timestamp
                        <= {{ DateTime(startDate, description="Historical cutoff", required=False) }}
                    {% else %} AND 1 = 0
                    {% end %}
            ),
            gitlab_base AS (
                SELECT
                    ds.startDate AS startDate,
                    ds.endDate AS endDate,
                    count(case when af.activityId != '' then 1 else null end) AS activityCount
                FROM generate_timeseries ds
                LEFT JOIN
                    (
                        SELECT timestamp, activityId
                        FROM
                            {% if defined(collectionSlug) %} activityRelations_collection_bucket_routing
                            {% else %} activityRelations_bucket_routing
                            {% end %} as a
                        WHERE
                            {% if defined(collectionSlug) %}
                                {% if defined(bucketId) %}
                                    segmentId IN (SELECT segmentId FROM segments_filtered_by_collection)
                                    AND a.collectionSlug = {{ String(collectionSlug) }}
                                {% else %} 1 = 0
                                {% end %}
                            {% else %} segmentId = (SELECT segmentId FROM segments_filtered)
                            {% end %}
                            AND type = 'star'
                            AND platform != 'github'
                            AND segmentId IN (SELECT segmentId FROM stars_gitlab_segments)
                            AND channel NOT IN (SELECT channel FROM repos_to_channels_excluded)
                            {% if defined(repos) %}
                                AND channel IN (SELECT channel FROM repos_to_channels)
                            {% end %}
                            {% if defined(startDate) %}
                                AND timestamp
                                > {{ DateTime(startDate, description="Filter after", required=False) }}
                            {% end %}
                            {% if defined(endDate) %}
                                AND timestamp
                                <= {{ DateTime(endDate, description="Filter before", required=False) }}
                            {% end %}
                    ) af
                    ON CASE
                        WHEN {{ granularity }} = 'daily'
                        THEN toDate(af.timestamp)
                        WHEN {{ granularity }} = 'weekly'
                        THEN toStartOfWeek(af.timestamp)
                        WHEN {{ granularity }} = 'monthly'
                        THEN toStartOfMonth(af.timestamp)
                        WHEN {{ granularity }} = 'quarterly'
                        THEN toStartOfQuarter(af.timestamp)
                        WHEN {{ granularity }} = 'yearly'
                        THEN toStartOfYear(af.timestamp)
                    END
                    = ds.startDate
                GROUP BY ds.startDate, ds.endDate
            ),
            rolling AS (
                SELECT startDate, endDate, activityCount, sumState(activityCount) AS cumulativeState
                FROM gitlab_base
                GROUP BY startDate, endDate, activityCount
            )
        SELECT
            startDate,
            endDate,
            COALESCE(sumMerge(cumulativeState) OVER (ORDER BY startDate ASC), 0)
            + (SELECT c FROM gitlab_historical) AS gitlabCumulativeStars
        FROM rolling
        ORDER BY startDate ASC
    {% else %} SELECT toDate(now()) AS startDate, toDate(now()) AS endDate, 0 AS gitlabCumulativeStars
    {% end %}

NODE stars_cumulative_count_final
SQL >
    %
    {% if defined(granularity) %}
        SELECT
            g.startDate AS startDate,
            g.endDate AS endDate,
            toUInt64(
                g.githubCumulativeStars + coalesce(gl.gitlabCumulativeStars, 0)
            ) AS cumulativeActivityCount
        FROM stars_github_bucketed g
        LEFT JOIN stars_gitlab_cumulative gl ON gl.startDate = g.startDate AND gl.endDate = g.endDate
        ORDER BY g.startDate ASC
    {% else %}
        SELECT
            toUInt64(
                (SELECT githubCumulativeStars FROM stars_github_summary)
                + (SELECT gitlabCumulativeStars FROM stars_gitlab_summary)
            ) AS cumulativeActivityCount
    {% end %}
